<title>USA: Banyan Systems Q4 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Banyan Systems Q4 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBORO, Mass. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banyan Systems Incorporated</p>
<p>Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			 Three months ended    Twelve months ended</p>
<p>			    December 31,	     December 31,</p>
<p>			     1996	 1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p>Total revenues	 17,162     27,977    105,424    129,683</p>
<p>Restructuring and other</p>
<p>	charges	  5,500 (a) 15,802 (b)  5,500 (a) 15,802(b)</p>
<p> Net loss	    ( 26,802)  ( 17,308)  ( 27,030)  ( 21,360)</p>
<p>Net loss per common share</p>
<p>			   ( 1.56)    ( 1.03)    ( 1.59)    ( 1.27)</p>
<p>Weighted average common shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	   17,133     16,758     16,947     16,797</p>
<p>NOTES: (a) In the fourth quarter of 1996, the company took a one time charge of $5,500 related to restructuring the company, and wrote off deferred tax assets of $8,038.</p>
<p>(b) In the fourth quarter of 1995, the company took a one-time charge of $15,802, resulting in an after-tax charge of $11,061 related to restructuring the company.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
